# Going down to be revived: V's health goes to nothing while another player
# is in the session (tandem-peer --revive N revives it), and V must be up
# again. Alone, the game refuses: V would die.
limit 180
needs session == 1
sim session
act hurt all
until down == 1 timeout 10
expect revive: our V is timeout 10
until down == 0 timeout 90
check hp > 0
